625
00:46:35,360 --> 00:46:36,860
Send him the location.

626
00:46:44,200 --> 00:46:46,840
Let's see who gets there first this time.

627
00:46:51,840 --> 00:46:55,900
This photo is so cute. He's so handsome.

628
00:46:55,930 --> 00:46:59,640
He looks just like a prince. Where should I put it?

629
00:47:02,180 --> 00:47:03,400
Not here.

630
00:47:03,500 --> 00:47:04,430
How about there?

631
00:47:04,790 --> 00:47:06,460
Yeah.

632
00:47:07,100 --> 00:47:07,900
How is it here?

633
00:47:10,510 --> 00:47:11,310
Oh.

634
00:47:11,330 --> 00:47:13,280
Where are you going, Mr. Phatsa?

635
00:47:13,840 --> 00:47:14,640
Oh.

636
00:47:15,150 --> 00:47:18,080
Nakhin and the others forgot to bring the documents.

637
00:47:18,560 --> 00:47:20,660
I'm driving over to deliver them now.

638
00:47:20,900 --> 00:47:21,700
Okay.

639
00:47:47,680 --> 00:47:50,520
Without physical attraction,

640
